SUMMARY:AI For Business: Practical Prompting for Everyday Work
DESCRIPTION:Want better results from AI? It starts with knowing what to ask and how to ask it.\n\nThis practical\, beginner-friendly workshop will show you how to give AI clearer instructions\, better context\, and useful feedback so you can get more relevant and reliable results.\n\nYou’ll learn a simple\, repeatable approach you can use with tools like ChatGPT\, Claude\, Gemini\, Copilot\, and other AI platforms to:\n\nWrite stronger prompts\nImprove responses that miss the mark\nAdd the right context and details\nAdapt prompts for everyday work tasks\nBuild prompts you can use again and again\n\nRegister here: https://sovainnovationhub.com/ai-programs/ai-workshops-for-business/
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Want better results from AI? It starts with knowing what to ask and how to ask it.\n\nThis practical\, beginner-friendly workshop will show you how to give AI clearer instructions\, better context\, and useful feedback so you can get more relevant and reliable results.\n\nYou’ll learn a simple\, repeatable approach you can use with tools like ChatGPT\, Claude\, Gemini\, Copilot\, and other AI platforms to:\n\nWrite stronger prompts\nImprove responses that miss the mark\nAdd the right context and details\nAdapt prompts for everyday work tasks\nBuild prompts you can use again and again\n\nRegister here: https://sovainnovationhub.com/ai-programs/ai-workshops-for-business/
